1
00:00:00,438 --> 00:00:02,699
Saat rem ABS bekerja,

2
00:00:02,719 --> 00:00:03,953
remmu justru dilepas lalu

3
00:00:03,973 --> 00:00:04,743
ditekan lagi,

4
00:00:04,763 --> 00:00:06,058
hingga lima belas kali per

5
00:00:06,078 --> 00:00:06,887
detik.

6
00:00:06,907 --> 00:00:08,048
Kenapa harus dilepas?

7
00:00:08,068 --> 00:00:09,349
Saat rem diinjak terlalu

8
00:00:09,369 --> 00:00:11,115
keras, apalagi di jalan licin,

9
00:00:11,135 --> 00:00:12,508
roda bisa berhenti berputar

10
00:00:12,528 --> 00:00:13,678
alias terkunci.

11
00:00:13,698 --> 00:00:15,231
Ban lalu terseret di aspal.

12
00:00:15,251 --> 00:00:16,865
Ban yang terseret mencengkeram

13
00:00:16,885 --> 00:00:18,506
jalan lebih lemah daripada ban

14
00:00:18,526 --> 00:00:19,726
yang masih berputar.

15
00:00:19,746 --> 00:00:20,972
Lebih parah lagi,

16
00:00:20,992 --> 00:00:22,381
roda yang terkunci tidak bisa

17
00:00:22,401 --> 00:00:23,196
dibelokkan.

18
00:00:23,216 --> 00:00:24,466
Setir kamu putar,

19
00:00:24,486 --> 00:00:26,397
mobil tetap meluncur lurus.

20
00:00:26,417 --> 00:00:28,782
ABS punya empat bagian utama:

21
00:00:28,802 --> 00:00:30,756
sensor kecepatan di roda,

22
00:00:30,776 --> 00:00:32,195
komputer pengendali,

23
00:00:32,215 --> 00:00:33,907
