24
00:00:33,927 --> 00:00:36,187
Sensor membaca putaran roda

25
00:00:36,207 --> 00:00:37,627
terus-menerus.

26
00:00:37,647 --> 00:00:39,175
Kalau satu roda tiba-tiba

27
00:00:39,195 --> 00:00:40,166
melambat jauh lebih cepat

28
00:00:40,186 --> 00:00:41,218
daripada mobilnya,

29
00:00:41,238 --> 00:00:42,658
komputer tahu roda itu hampir

30
00:00:42,678 --> 00:00:43,639
terkunci.

31
00:00:43,659 --> 00:00:45,434
Komputer lalu menutup katup

32
00:00:45,454 --> 00:00:47,354
supaya tekanan rem tidak naik,

33
00:00:47,374 --> 00:00:48,499
atau membuang sebagian

34
00:00:48,519 --> 00:00:49,656
tekanannya.

35
00:00:49,676 --> 00:00:51,093
Roda kembali berputar.

36
00:00:51,113 --> 00:00:52,207
Pompa lalu mengembalikan

37
00:00:52,227 --> 00:00:54,058
tekanan, dan siklus ini

38
00:00:54,078 --> 00:00:55,271
berulang terus.

39
00:00:55,291 --> 00:00:56,618
Itulah getaran yang terasa di

40
00:00:56,638 --> 00:00:57,350
pedal rem.

41
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:58,619
Lima belas kali lepas dan

42
00:00:58,639 --> 00:01:00,314
tekan dalam satu detik.

43
00:01:00,334 --> 00:01:01,429
Kaki manusia tidak akan

44
00:01:01,449 --> 00:01:02,932
sanggup secepat itu.

45
00:01:02,952 --> 00:01:04,093
Sistem elektronik ini

46
00:01:04,113 --> 00:01:05,471
dikembangkan Mercedes-Benz

47
00:01:05,491 --> 00:01:06,647
bersama Bosch,

48
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:08,257
lalu dipasang di S-Class mulai

49
00:01:08,277 --> 00:01:09,310
akhir tahun seribu sembilan

50
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:10,481
ratus tujuh puluh delapan.

51
00:01:10,501 --> 00:01:12,593
Jadi saat pedal bergetar,

52
00:01:12,613 --> 00:01:14,636
tetap injak rem dengan mantap

53
00:01:14,656 --> 00:01:15,952
dan arahkan setirmu.

54
00:01:15,972 --> 00:01:17,701
Ini AUDIRA,

55
00:01:17,721 --> 00:01:19,017
Cara Kerja Benda.

56
00:01:19,037 --> 00:01:20,271
Episode berikutnya:

57
00:01:20,291 --> 00:01:21,867
termos air panas.

